hadiths[3]{hadithnumber,text}:
"31","[AI-translation] Haddasana Amr bin Khalid, haddasana Zuhair, haddasana Abu Ishaq, 'anil Baraa', qala: Ek aadmi Surah Al-Kahf padh raha tha aur uske pasbaale mein do rasso se baandha hua ek ghoda tha. Pas ek badal ne us par chha gaya, aur woh qareeb aata raha, aur uska ghoda phisalne laga. Jab subah hui to woh Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ke paas aaye aur yeh baat unhe batayi. To Aap (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Yeh sakinah thi jo Quran ke sath utri."
"32","[AI-translation] Abud Darda se riwayat hai ke Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Jo shakhs Surah Al-Kahf ki shuruat ki das aayat yaad kar lega, woh Dajjal se mehfooz rakha jayega."
"33","[AI-translation] Abu Dawud ne kaha: Aur Hisham Ad-Dastawa'i ne bhi Qatada se isi tarah riwayat ki magar unhone kaha: ""Jo Surah Al-Kahf ki aakhri aayat se yaad kare."" Aur Shu'ba ne Qatada se riwayat ki: ""Al-Kahf ke aakhir se."
